<title>USA: SubMicron Systems names David Ferran CEO.</title>
<headline>SubMicron Systems names David Ferran CEO.</headline>
<dateline>ALLENTOWN, Pa. 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>SubMicron Systems Corp said Wednesday it named David Ferran president, chief executive, and a member of the board of directors.</p>
<p>SubMicron said Ferran will replace company founder David Levy, who is resigning from his position but will remain a member of the board.</p>
<p>The company said Ferran was previously chairman, chief executive and president of Tylan General Inc.</p>
</text>
